# Transporting (adoulin 82): a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin. Vaulois at 49 Adoulin fame (level 1, a GM): no
# section (default 520). Fame 50 (level 2): 2590, finished on 0: begun (any option), the Misdelivered Parcel. Available
# again at fame 125 (level 3, GMs): 2590, finished on 2: begun. Accepted, Prog 0: Vaulois nothing from the quest
# (default 520); qm_sluice_gate_6 (Rala Waterways) nothing (default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY); Kongramm 2592, finished:
# Prog 1; Kongramm at Prog 1: nothing from the quest (his script: nothing; default 558); Vaulois at Prog 1: nothing.
# qm_sluice_gate_6 at Prog 1: 2802, finished: the parcel lost (KEYITEM_LOST), Prog 2; at Prog 2: nothing. Kongramm at
# Prog 2: nothing. Vaulois at Prog 3 (a GM): nothing; at Prog 2: 2591, finished: completed (300 bayld, 1000 exp).
# Completed: Vaulois default 520; Kongramm at Prog 0 (a GM): nothing from the quest.
lists WesternAdoulin/Vaulois/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Kongramm/onTrigger RalaWaterways/qm_sluice_gate_6/onTrigger
lists WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2590 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2591 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2592
lists RalaWaterways/onEventFinish/2802
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=21.5,0,85 job=WAR lvl=99
fame Adoulin 49
login
trigger Vaulois                         # available, fame level 1: no section: default 520
finish-if-event
fame Adoulin 50                         # a GM: level 2
trigger Vaulois                         # available, level 2: 2590
finish option=0                         # begun (any option); the Misdelivered Parcel
quest Adoulin.Transporting available    # a GM
fame Adoulin 125                        # a GM: level 3
trigger Vaulois                         # available, level 3: 2590
finish option=2                         # begun
trigger Vaulois                         # Prog 0: nothing from the quest: default 520
finish-if-event
warp -561.5,-5.768,61.5 RalaWaterways
trigger qm_sluice_gate_6                # Prog 0: nothing: default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 62.5,32,138 WesternAdoulin
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 0: 2592
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 1: nothing from the quest: his script (nothing) / default 558
finish-if-event
trigger Vaulois                         # Prog 1: nothing from the quest: default 520
finish-if-event
warp -561.5,-5.768,61.5 RalaWaterways
trigger qm_sluice_gate_6                # Prog 1: 2802
finish                                  # the parcel lost (KEYITEM_LOST); Prog 2
trigger qm_sluice_gate_6                # Prog 2: nothing: default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 62.5,32,138 WesternAdoulin
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 2: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[9][82]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Vaulois                         # Prog 3: nothing from the quest: default 520
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[9][82]Prog 2              # a GM
trigger Vaulois                         # Prog 2: 2591
finish                                  # completed
trigger Vaulois                         # completed: no section: default 520
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[9][82]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Kongramm                        # completed, Prog 0: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
